- `bridge/view`: the source cone over directions is expressed directly on the existing chapter
  generated-cone owner surface `cone[R] (ray S1)`.

Domain-style sampling used here:
- `rayOfNeZero R`;
- `SameRay.sameRay_nonneg_smul_left`;
